koinos-hwcaps (1.0-1~koinos1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Agile611 Koinos RISC-V hwcaps support for RVA23U64
  * Creates glibc-hwcaps directory structure for RVA23U64
  * Provides hwprobe detection and IFUNC verification scripts
  * Sub-packages for optimized OpenSSL, libgcrypt, libjpeg-turbo

